#SKIPTEST
#chip 16F1829, 8

'Repeat For test (Change 1654): Wait 5 s = 10,000,000 cycles is over the 8,000,000-cycle limit for an inline Wait
'Expect: compile error (this file is marked #SKIPTEST so the demo sweep ignores it):
'  Repeat For: this Wait is too long to build inline inside the loop body (limit 8,000,000 clock cycles at this clock speed) - use a shorter Wait

#option explicit

Repeat for 30 s
    Wait 5 s
End Repeat
Do
Loop
